221
00:13:53,100 --> 00:13:56,020
It's hard to believe now, but they were comrades once.

222
00:13:56,020 --> 00:14:01,620
If he was one of yours, then why did he create the magic tools?

223
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:05,700
Well, there was a lot going on back then.

224
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:08,280
What a great explanation, thank you.

225
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:09,880
How should I put it?

226
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:13,400
Well, he always loved playing with machines.

227
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:14,960
Yes, very helpful.

228
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,800
Oh, jeez.

229
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:17,960
Well...

230
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:23,720
His original goal was to preserve and protect order in the world.

231
00:14:24,060 --> 00:14:26,920
That's why he began his research into magic tools.

232
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:30,660
