234
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:39,060
And, of course, the more powerful the object is,

235
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:42,580
the greater the danger of it falling into the wrong hands.

236
00:14:44,460 --> 00:14:47,760
Abon knew all this, but he had faith in humanity,

237
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:50,360
so he continued his research nonetheless.

238
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:54,740
