253
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:47,080
Abon's obsession with immortality was born because he desperately sought to save his beloved.

254
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:54,080
But no matter how great the inventor or how noble the cause, transcending death is an impossible feat.

255
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:57,760
Not even Abon could hope to succeed in such an endeavor.

256
00:15:57,760 --> 00:16:04,420
But when all seemed lost, someone appeared by his side, offering help and comforting words.

257
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:05,980
