265
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:26,500
Abon and Arachne joined forces.

266
00:16:26,500 --> 00:16:31,400
They combined his research into immortality with her research on magic weapons.

267
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:35,420
And from that, the magic tool Brew came into being.

268
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:43,380
Long ago, I met a man whose eyes looked exactly like yours do now.

269
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:46,320
He bore the same star tattoo as well.

270
00:16:46,320 --> 00:17:00,660
He showed no mercy, even to those who deserved it.

271
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:04,660
You, your StarClan.

272
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:09,540
