273
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:11,820
Oh, please.

274
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,980
What use do I have for paths?

275
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:16,020
I'm here to win, plain and simple.

276
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:17,640
That's all that matters.

277
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:20,580
It's not too late.

278
00:17:20,900 --> 00:17:21,960
Stop while you can.

279
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,220
That's enough.

280
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,900
I'm done listening.

281
00:17:26,280 --> 00:17:28,560
Yeah, that's a great story, Samurai.

282
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:32,460
But why should I care about some dumb clan that got itself wiped out?

283
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:35,880
Because the child of a demon is a demon as well.

284
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:38,740
Your path has been decided for you.

285
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:39,500
Shut up!

286
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:51,060
You have the strength to be so much more.

287
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:52,100
So why this?

288
00:17:52,260 --> 00:17:54,320
There's nothing greater in this life than winning.

289
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:56,720
Victory's always the path I choose.

290
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:59,260
You're wielding a double-edged sword.

291
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:02,320
It may kill your opponents, but it's cutting your soul as well.

292
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:08,860
White Star.

293
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:12,080
He was the first man I ever truly feared.

294
00:18:13,140 --> 00:18:16,040
But feared as he was, he was not fearless himself.

295
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:20,120
The thought that he might one day be defeated made him tremble.

296
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:22,740
It shook him to the very depths of his soul.

297
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:26,680
Man, for a samurai, you sure talk a lot.

298
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,060
You're different, though.

299
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:30,500
You've already tasted defeat, haven't you?

300
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:31,620
What did you say?

301
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:38,040
He strayed from the path for a reason.

302
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,120
Perhaps you should hear it before you decide.

303
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,520
All right, White Star.

304
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:46,280
Let's end this.

305
00:18:50,940 --> 00:18:51,860
Your eyes.

306
00:18:52,980 --> 00:18:55,460
You aren't even human anymore, are you?

307
00:19:00,500 --> 00:19:04,460
He couldn't conquer the darkness inside himself.

308
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:05,840
What about you?

309
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:09,620
Will you fight that darkness, or will you become a demon, too?

310
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:11,300
I'm not gonna lose.

311
00:19:11,620 --> 00:19:13,300
He was defeated because he was weak.

312
00:19:13,660 --> 00:19:14,700
I'll show you.

313
00:19:15,060 --> 00:19:16,240
I'm stronger than him!

314
00:19:18,380 --> 00:19:19,560
You foolish boy.

315
00:19:19,740 --> 00:19:20,720
He wasn't weak.

316
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:39,100
No matter what, he always had to push harder, reach higher.

317
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:41,020
He never knew when to stop.

318
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:42,100
Because of that...

319
00:19:43,100 --> 00:19:44,520
The what?

320
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,200
He lost himself.

321
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:48,280
The warrior became a demon.

322
00:19:48,280 --> 00:19:56,900
I'll ask you again.

323
00:19:57,980 --> 00:19:59,660
Which path will you follow?

324
00:20:00,180 --> 00:20:02,740
That of the warrior, or of the demon?

325
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:04,980
Shut up, samurai.

326
00:20:05,580 --> 00:20:07,200
You don't know what you're talking about.

327
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:11,780
You're nothing but a fool if you think you can order me around.

328
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:26,560
You've chosen the demon.

329
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,480
I can do nothing more for you.

330
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:36,000
Blackstar!

331
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:45,380
How delicious this power is.

332
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:48,000
Reduce them to lumps of flesh.

333
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:59,440
You have a habit of popping up at unexpected times, Excalibur.

334
00:21:00,500 --> 00:21:01,720
Why are you here now?

335
00:21:01,820 --> 00:21:03,200
Did you come to see Abon?

336
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:04,160
Ha!

337
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:05,980
That's just a bonus.

338
00:21:06,800 --> 00:21:09,660
My reason goes a great deal deeper than that.

339
00:21:09,840 --> 00:21:10,200
Oh.

340
00:21:10,560 --> 00:21:12,120
You're here to help us out, then.

341
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:12,800
Fool!

342
00:21:12,800 --> 00:21:13,960
That isn't it.

343
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:18,040
I've come to observe.

344
00:21:20,040 --> 00:21:22,040
Now, let's begin.

345
00:21:26,500 --> 00:21:28,740
Baru, unlock.

346
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:55,960
Baru, unlock.

347
00:21:59,600 --> 00:22:01,040
Baru, unlock.

348
00:22:03,120 --> 00:22:03,400
Baru, even.

349
00:22:05,540 --> 00:22:06,180
itätenkas

350
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:09,160
Baru, unlock.

351
00:22:09,380 --> 00:22:10,500
Baru, unlock.

352
00:22:10,500 --> 00:22:40,480
Thank you.

353
00:22:40,500 --> 00:23:10,480
Thank you.

354
00:23:10,500 --> 00:23:12,260
Weapons locked and loaded.

355
00:23:12,740 --> 00:23:13,900
All system lights are green.

356
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:15,300
Lord Death, we're ready.

357
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:16,400
Good.

358
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:18,860
Death City Robot, fight mode.

359
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:19,340
Transform.

360
00:23:19,780 --> 00:23:20,100
Ta-da!

361
00:23:20,360 --> 00:23:22,260
Well, that was a fun game, Azusa.

362
00:23:22,740 --> 00:23:24,480
But does this thing actually transform?

363
00:23:24,840 --> 00:23:25,740
Of course it doesn't.

364
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:27,640
On the next episode of Soul Eater,

365
00:23:27,940 --> 00:23:29,640
the miraculous coffee table flip,

366
00:23:29,940 --> 00:23:30,340
fly.

367
00:23:30,740 --> 00:23:31,920
Our Death City Robot.

368
00:23:32,300 --> 00:23:33,620
I told you, it doesn't transform.

369
00:23:34,060 --> 00:23:34,580
Oh, really?

